<title>USA: Hoffman Estates Park, Ill., won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Hoffman Estates Park, Ill., won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc., said it won $1.745 million of Hoffman Estates Park Dist., Ill., general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 3.90 percent.</p>
</text>
